{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.poster.avif?t=1772311527\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.webm?t=1772311527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.mp4?t=1772311527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The robots didn\u2019t just go rogue. They destroyed every connection.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmony's a scientist working on an experimental AI made from mushrooms, and Melody, her partner, just wants a quiet night together. But when the town\u2019s machines suddenly attack and Harmony disappears, Melody finds herself drawn into a search she doesn\u2019t fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bd821cdcadd184e22b503e04cec36d5d.poster.avif?t=1772311527\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bd821cdcadd184e22b503e04cec36d5d.webm?t=1772311527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bd821cdcadd184e22b503e04cec36d5d.mp4?t=1772311527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singularity RPG is a hand-drawn, story-driven game that blends classic RPG systems with emotional storytelling, where turn-based battles drive you through a narrative shaped by your choices, your dialogue, and the connections you make along the way. As you dig deeper, you\u2019ll meet other characters, uncover mysteries, navigate moments of grief, and confront the question at the heart of it all: what do we hold onto when everything we trusted breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/1fe71e005dda912ee414db4d1cada6d0.poster.avif?t=1772311527\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/1fe71e005dda912ee414db4d1cada6d0.webm?t=1772311527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/1fe71e005dda912ee414db4d1cada6d0.mp4?t=1772311527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an original soundtrack by <strong>Martin Biesecke</strong>, the music does more than add  emotional weight onto each scene, it becomes part of the mystery itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>In a world where all networks are broken, something is still connecting you.</i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699610?t=1772311527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/299aa465fc7b892ac43e79447c4189f896804332/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772311527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/692cbcbc0bfd6d1f14a74a1a0fd3618bb81471c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772311527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/692cbcbc0bfd6d1f14a74a1a0fd3618bb81471c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772311527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3699770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.poster.avif?t=1772311527\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.webm?t=1772311527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.mp4?t=1772311527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The robots didn\u2019t just go rogue. They destroyed every connection.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmony's a scientist working on an experimental AI made from mushrooms, and Melody, her partner, just wants a quiet night together. But when the town\u2019s machines suddenly attack and Harmony disappears, Melody finds herself drawn into a search she doesn\u2019t fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bd821cdcadd1